2026-08-25T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-1124) 'The RFD structure gate reads a CommonMark AST
 # uuid: 935c5778-f793-5059-898b-e598ede58a05
 # tags: rfd:title, rfd:attest-in:none
 RFD:Committed  1 RFD
 Serials:Weftspun

2026-08-25T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-1124) '`scripts/check-rfd-structure.py`, `scripts/check-rfd-numbers.py`, `scripts/requirements.txt`, `.pre-commit-config.yaml`, `.github/workflows/checks.yml`
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-1124) 'A gate that reads RFDs as a CommonMark AST sees what a byte scan misses.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1124) 'This repository held 116 RFDs and one gate. That gate checked numbers. Nothing checked the shape of a document, so the shape stayed an agreement each writer kept from memory.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1124) 'Check a new rule against every RFD, with no exception list, before it joins `scripts/check-rfd-structure.py`.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1124) 'The RFD structure gate reads a CommonMark AST
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1124) '`scripts/check-rfd-structure.py` parses each `README.md` and `DETAILS.md` into a CommonMark AST and checks the document against that tree. It joins the inline text of a paragraph before it matches, so a wrapped citation is one citation. It found all 37.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1124) 'Each rule ran against all 116 RFDs before it became a rule. A rule that needed an exception did not ship. The gate reads both its state list and its README line limit out of RFD66606-1000, so document and gate cannot drift apart. It takes one dependency, `markdown-it-py`, pinned. The number gate keeps numbering only, and its weaker citation scan moved here.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1124) 'RFD66606-1000 gives the conventions this gate measures. RFD66606-1063 moves the prose rules to a plugin, and this gate checks structure only.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1124) 'How the rules were chosen
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-1124) 'Every candidate rule ran against all 116 RFDs before it became a check. A rule that held with no exception shipped. A rule that needed an exception list did not, and appears under "Measured and not gated" below, with its count, because an omitted check reads exactly like a passing one.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-1124) 'The survey script parsed each `README.md` and `DETAILS.md` with `markdown-it-py` and counted heading sequences, preamble fields, states, citations, and sibling files. It is not kept, because `check-rfd-structure.py` now asserts what it measured.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-1124) 'The rules, and what each measured
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-1124) '| rule | held before the gate |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-1124) '| ---- | -------------------- |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-1124) '| One level-1 heading, and it opens the document | 116 of 116 |
 # tags: rfd:details
