 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-1124) '| Every citation resolves to a directory or an ALIASES.md row | 116 of 116 |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-1124) '| No citation uses the old decimal form | 84 of 116 |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-1124) '| A README names its `DETAILS.md` (rescinded, see below) | 87 of 89 |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1124  1 LINE
 Text:Written

